Value SOFTWARE_VERSION (.+)
Value VRP_VERSION (.+)
Value PRODUCT_NAME (\S+)
Value UPTIME (.+)
Value PATCH_VERSION (.+)

Start
  ^.*VRP \(R\) software,\s+Version\s+${VRP_VERSION} -> Continue
  ^.*Version\s+\S+\s+\(${PRODUCT_NAME}\s+${SOFTWARE_VERSION}\)
  ^.*uptime is\s+${UPTIME}
  ^Patch Version:\s+${PATCH_VERSION}
